es as director the 57 year old  britain established his reputation above  all with the production of the last four  harry potter films after all he made a  significant contribution to their  success as director yates was equally in  charge of the first two fantastic beasts  movies the screenplay was not penned by  an unknown author from hollywood either  but by harry potter creator and  best-selling author jk rowling according  to kevin sushihara the president of  warner brothers at the time rowling  worked extremely hard on the script so  that it would turn out even better than  its predecessors shooting was supposed  to start in the summer of 2019 but was  then moved to february 2020 in favor of  better pre-production since the film is  supposed to be bigger and even better  than its preceding titles the actual  start of filming was then not until  september 2020 due to the pandemic and  after brief hiatus due to a case of  infection it was finally completed in  may 2021 a lot of the not so well-known  members of the crew such as said  designer stuart craig were also already  involved in the harry potter series and  sadly ensure the proper atmosphere  let's now move on to the possible plot  of fantastic beasts the secrets of  dumbledore first of all let's take a  look at the story of the two prequels to  refresh your memory in the first part we  see nude arriving in new york city in  1926 with a suitcase in it are of course  all sorts of little animals that he  managed to find on his journey such as a  niffler and his boat truckles we quickly  realized that the mood is very tense in  the city as more and more prejudice and  hostility from the population is  building up against the secretly  operating magical society things get  even worse when mario jacob kowalski  accidentally opens nude suitcase causing  some of the animals to escape as a  result he ensures that chaos takes its  course as they try to recapture the  animals together with two witch sisters  they must face some dangerous opponents  the plot of the second part picks up  more or less directly from the first one  but as the title already reveals it is  particularly centered on the villain  grindelwald the dark wizard's ambitious  goal is to control the muggles through  pure blood wizards these plans soon  become serious when grindelwald with the  help of machus abernathy manages to  escape during a prisoner transport and  quickly gathers a considerable number of  followers newt is eventually contacted  by albus dumbledore and asked to attend  to the matter and thwart grindelwald's  plans in paris by the way the second  part did not really generate much  enthusiasm among the fan community and  apart from a convincing performance by  johnny depp will definitely not go down  in film history so unlike the first part  which was mostly well received many seem  to perceive fantastic beasts the crimes  of grindelwald as a downgrade this makes  the way for fantastic beasts the secret  of dumbledore all the more exciting  since warner and the team seem to be  doing everything in their power to make  the third part more elaborate and epic  fittingly warner ceo kevin sujihara also  spoke out in an interview with the los  angeles times in 2019 in which he  clarified that the second part didn't do  so well and that everything must be done  to make the third movie even better than  the first still can anyone even suspect  what jk rowling and writing partner  steve cloves have put on paper and all  this time incidentally the latter was  also involved in the scripts for almost  all the harry potter films but anyway so  far there are no exact details about the  story but it seems that the story of  newt will not be over after the third  part it has always been clear that the  movie series would end up consisting of  five parts culminating in the big  showdown between albus dumbledore and  his former friend gallagh grindelwald in  1945 accordingly fantastic beasts the  secrets of 